            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided is an inorganic fiber mat produced by a method of producing an inorganic fiber mat, the method comprising: a preparing step of preparing a first inorganic fiber molding including an organic binder attached thereto and derived from a needle-punched mat; a defibrating step of defibrating the first inorganic fiber molding to obtain defibrated inorganic fibers; and a papermaking step of forming the inorganic fiber mat by papermaking using a slurry containing the defibrated inorganic fibers.</p>
